# Container entrypoints MUST be LF. A CRLF checkout makes Linux fail them with
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M", which is an opaque way to lose an
# afternoon. core.autocrlf=true happens to normalize these on commit today —
# this makes it a guarantee instead of a local setting.
*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.template      text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
